#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:338
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / introduction"
msgid ""
"# Cookie Policy\n"
"\n"
"**Last updated:** {{LAST_UPDATED_DATE}}\n"
"\n"
"This Cookie Policy explains how **{{COMPANY_NAME}}** (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\") uses cookies and similar technologies on this website, in compliance with the Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA) of South Africa and the regulations issued by the Information Regulator."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:347
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-1"
msgid ""
"## Who we are\n"
"\n"
"The responsible party for the processing of your personal information through cookies is:\n"
"\n"
"- **Responsible party:** {{COMPANY_NAME}}\n"
"- **Address:** {{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}\n"
"- **Email:** {{COMPANY_EMAIL}}\n"
"- **Registry / registration number:** {{COMPANY_REGISTRY}}\n"
"- **Information Officer:** {{DPO_NAME}} — {{DPO_EMAIL}}"
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:360
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-2"
msgid ""
"## What are cookies\n"
"\n"
"Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit our website. They allow us to recognize your device on subsequent visits, remember your preferences, measure how the site is used, and (with your consent) deliver personalized advertising.\n"
"\n"
"We also use similar technologies such as **localStorage**, **sessionStorage**, and **pixel tags**. Where this policy refers to \"cookies\", it covers these technologies as well."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:369
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-3"
msgid ""
"## Lawful basis for processing\n"
"\n"
"For **strictly necessary** cookies, processing is justified because it is necessary to pursue our legitimate interests in operating a secure, functional website (POPIA section 11(1)(f)) and does not override your interests or rights.\n"
"\n"
"For the **non-essential categories configured behind our cookie banner**, processing is based on your **consent** under POPIA section 11(1)(a) — a voluntary, specific and informed expression of will — collected before those cookies are set. POPIA section 11(1)(b)-(f) permits other lawful justifications; this policy uses consent for these configured categories and must be adapted if our actual processing relies on a different justification.\n"
"\n"
"Personal information collected through these technologies may include online identifiers, device and browser information, usage events, approximate location, and the preferences described in the cookie table and our separate Privacy Policy. Providing information through non-essential technologies is voluntary; if you refuse, the related analytics, personalization, or advertising functions will not operate. Processing needed to deliver and secure the website is necessary for those technical functions, and blocking it may prevent parts of the site from working.\n"
"\n"
"You can withdraw consent at any time using the \"Cookie settings\" link or by clearing your cookies (POPIA section 11(2)(b)). Withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing carried out before withdrawal."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:382
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-4"
msgid ""
"## Cookies used on this site\n"
"\n"
"{{COOKIE_CATEGORIES}}"
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:389
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-5"
msgid ""
"## Third-party services\n"
"\n"
"Where you give consent, this site may load resources from or transmit personal information to the following third-party services. Depending on their configuration, they may use cookies or other technologies:\n"
"\n"
"{{THIRD_PARTY_SERVICES}}\n"
"\n"
"The legal role of each third party depends on the actual arrangement: it may determine its own purposes as a separate responsible party or process information on our behalf as an operator under a contract or mandate. Before transferring personal information outside South Africa, we require a substantially similar level of protection through applicable law, binding corporate rules, or a binding agreement, or rely on another ground permitted by POPIA section 72. Recipient and safeguard details are provided in our [Privacy Policy]({{PRIVACY_POLICY_URL}})."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:400
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-6"
msgid ""
"## Direct marketing\n"
"\n"
"Under POPIA section 69, electronic direct marketing to non-customers requires your prior consent, and any marketing communication you receive must include a way to opt out."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:407
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-7"
msgid ""
"## How long we keep data\n"
"\n"
"Personal information collected directly by us through cookies is retained only for as long as necessary for the stated purpose and, where no shorter cookie-specific period is shown, for no longer than the declared fallback period of {{RETENTION_PERIOD}}, unless a longer period is authorised or required by law. See the table above for each cookie's lifetime and the Privacy Policy for retention controlled by third parties. Under POPIA section 14, information that is no longer authorised for retention is deleted, destroyed, or de-identified as soon as reasonably practicable."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:414
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-8"
msgid ""
"## Your rights\n"
"\n"
"Under POPIA (Chapter 3, condition 8, and sections 23-25) you have the right to:\n"
"\n"
"- be notified that your personal information is being collected (section 18)\n"
"- access the personal information we hold about you (section 23)\n"
"- request correction or deletion of inaccurate, irrelevant, excessive, or unlawfully obtained information (section 24)\n"
"- object to processing based on legitimate interest (section 11(3))\n"
"- object to processing for direct marketing purposes (section 11(3)(b) and section 69)\n"
"- withdraw consent at any time (section 11(2)(b))\n"
"- not be subject — save for the exceptions in section 71(2) — to a decision based solely on automated processing intended to profile you, where it has legal consequences for you or affects you to a substantial degree (section 71)\n"
"- submit a complaint to the Information Regulator (South Africa) — [{{OFFICIAL_RESOURCES_URL}}]({{OFFICIAL_RESOURCES_URL}}); complaints email: **{{INFOREG_CONTACT}}**\n"
"\n"
"To exercise these rights contact us at **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**; where an Information Officer is named under \"Who we are\" above, you may address your request to them directly. We will respond as soon as reasonably practicable; for requests of access to your personal information, section 25 of the Promotion of Access to Information Act, 2000 (PAIA) provides a 30-day response period."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:432
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-9"
msgid ""
"## Changes to this policy\n"
"\n"
"We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. The \"Last updated\" date at the top reflects the most recent revision. A change that affects the scope or validity of consent may require a new choice through the cookie banner; you can review or change your current choice at any time through \"Cookie settings\"."
msgstr ""

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:439
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-10"
msgid ""
"## Contact\n"
"\n"
"For any question about this Cookie Policy, contact us at **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**."
msgstr ""

